Preamble
--------
Through this licence, CERN wishes to stimulate the open and collaborative development of hardware designs. It was drafted to ensure that all contributors to a design receive the benefits of collaborative development, while protecting the rights of creators.
The CERN-OHL-S is a strongly reciprocal licence: all modifications to the source, and any product based directly on the design, must be released under the same terms.
